        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Chrome 49 supports `Proxy.revocable`]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30885</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30885"/>
        <updated>2026-10-16T07:05:36.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121812333?u=e73c9ea79ec026b3d41ea0b56e862429f658ad9b&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>
<p dir="auto">Sets Chrome <code class="notranslate">version_added</code> for <code class="notranslate">javascript.builtins.Proxy.revocable</code> to 49, the same as <code class="notranslate">Proxy</code>. Chrome Android, WebView Android and Opera are mirrored, so they follow.</p>
<h4 dir="auto">Test results and supporting details</h4>
<p dir="auto"><a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/puckey/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/puckey">@puckey</a>'s real-browser results in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5728197464" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30765" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30765/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30765">#30765</a>: <code class="notranslate">Proxy.revocable</code> exists and revocation throws in Chrome 49, 61, 62 and 63; Chrome 48 has no <code class="notranslate">Proxy</code>. Node.js already lists 6.0.0 (V8 5.0).</p>
<h4 dir="auto">Related issues</h4>
<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #30765.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5728197464" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30765" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30765/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30765">#30765</a></p>]]></content>
