        <title type="html"><![CDATA[feat: add COEP and COOP Report-Only header compatibility data]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30883</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30883"/>
        <updated>2026-10-15T18:47:34.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/185269030?u=1fc22565ccf4566b6f734fabaa87e03d9a31cfe4&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Summary</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Add compatibility data for the <code class="notranslate">Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy-Report-Only</code> header.</li>
<li>Add compatibility data for the <code class="notranslate">Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy-Report-Only</code> header.</li>
<li>Include support data for the <code class="notranslate">report-to</code> parameter where applicable.</li>
<li>Follow the existing BCD schema and browser-data conventions.</li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>COEP specification: <a href="https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#coep" rel="nofollow">https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#coep</a></li>
<li>COOP specification: <a href="https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#the-coop-headers" rel="nofollow">https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#the-coop-headers</a></li>
<li>COOP <code class="notranslate">report-to</code> parameter: <a href="https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#coop-report-to" rel="nofollow">https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#coop-report-to</a></li>
<li>Chromium implementation references:
<ul dir="auto">
<li>[<a href="https://github.com/chromium/chromium/commit/3a5403f93080f">COEP Report-Only</a>](<a class="commit-link" data-hovercard-type="commit" data-hovercard-url="https://github.com/chromium/chromium/commit/3a5403f93080f/hovercard" href="https://github.com/chromium/chromium/commit/3a5403f93080f">chromium/chromium@<tt>3a5403f93080f</tt></a>)</li>
<li>[<a href="https://github.com/chromium/chromium/commit/34f3929a02f3e">COOP Report-Only parsing</a>](<a class="commit-link" data-hovercard-type="commit" data-hovercard-url="https://github.com/chromium/chromium/commit/34f3929a02f3e/hovercard" href="https://github.com/chromium/chromium/commit/34f3929a02f3e">chromium/chromium@<tt>34f3929a02f3e</tt></a>)</li>
<li>[<a href="https://github.com/chromium/chromium/commit/6d057a138091d">COOP reporting enabled by default</a>](<a class="commit-link" data-hovercard-type="commit" data-hovercard-url="https://github.com/chromium/chromium/commit/6d057a138091d/hovercard" href="https://github.com/chromium/chromium/commit/6d057a138091d">chromium/chromium@<tt>6d057a138091d</tt></a>)</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>Firefox implementation tracking: <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1652926" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1652926</a></li>
<li>Existing BCD entries were used as structural references for the compatibility-data format.</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #30837.">Closes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5800385574" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30837" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30837/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30837">#30837</a></p>]]></content>
