    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Add pathLength to SVG geometry elements]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30790</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30790"/>
        <updated>2026-10-08T10:35:30.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105274?u=173310b843e2751843265438af8cfb79eda02039&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Adds <code class="notranslate">pathLength</code> to <code class="notranslate">&lt;path&gt;</code>, <code class="notranslate">&lt;circle&gt;</code>, <code class="notranslate">&lt;ellipse&gt;</code>, <code class="notranslate">&lt;line&gt;</code>, <code class="notranslate">&lt;polygon&gt;</code>, <code class="notranslate">&lt;polyline&gt;</code> and <code class="notranslate">&lt;rect&gt;</code></li>
<li>Support versions reflect actual rendering, meaning <code class="notranslate">stroke-dasharray</code> and <code class="notranslate">stroke-dashoffset</code> scaled by <code class="notranslate">pathLength</code></li>
<li><code class="notranslate">&lt;path&gt;</code>: Chrome 50, Firefox 6, Safari 14</li>
<li>Other shapes: Chrome 57, Firefox 61, Safari 14</li>
<li>Safari reflected the attribute in the DOM long before it affected rendering</li>
</ul>
<h4 dir="auto">Test results and supporting details</h4>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Tested in Chrome 154, Firefox 157 and Safari 27 by drawing each shape to a canvas with <code class="notranslate">stroke-dasharray</code> in <code class="notranslate">pathLength</code> units and sampling pixels along the stroke</li>
<li>Chrome 50, <code class="notranslate">&lt;path&gt;</code>: <a href="https://crbug.com/536217" rel="nofollow">https://crbug.com/536217</a> (r373110)</li>
<li>Chrome 57, other shapes: <a href="https://crbug.com/596043" rel="nofollow">https://crbug.com/596043</a>, <a href="https://codereview.chromium.org/2525233002" rel="nofollow">https://codereview.chromium.org/2525233002</a> (r435194)</li>
<li>Firefox 6, <code class="notranslate">&lt;path&gt;</code>: <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=643419" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=643419</a></li>
<li>Firefox 61, other shapes: <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1325320" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1325320</a> (the stroke-dash code checks for <code class="notranslate">&lt;path&gt;</code> at <code class="notranslate">FIREFOX_60_0_RELEASE</code> and any shape at <code class="notranslate">FIREFOX_61_0_RELEASE</code>)</li>
<li>Safari 14: <a href="https://webkit.org/b/72401" rel="nofollow">https://webkit.org/b/72401</a> (r254657, January 2020, WebKit 610), scaling applied to any <code class="notranslate">SVGGeometryElement</code></li>
</ul>
